"Søren is a nervous Light Shaper in Alden Thorn's CNH hero class, nicknamed Glow Boy."
"Heights are his nemesis; he froze three-quarters up the rescue scaffold."
"He can make places hot given long enough, and may develop invisibility."
"In hero PE he is in Alden's struggles-to-deal-damage group and was sent to learn punching."
"He is an A-rank of the ultra-rare Light Shaper subclass and Reinhard's roommate in Suite 313."
"He badly burned himself practicing and refused ET; Alden preserved him and teleported him out."
"He put many points into Strength and feels like the class joke."
"In the December gym challenge he blasted Winston with shaped light, cracking his sunglasses."
